 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Satellite image ©2026 Vantor via AP 🛰️ New satellite images of Syapru Besi, Nepal, reveal the extent of the devastation caused by Wednesday's catastrophic flash flooding. Nearly 600 people died and almost 2,500 remain missing. Get the latest . 🧑‍⚖️ Jurors are still deliberating in the murder trial of Lindsay Clancy, a former labor and delivery nurse charged with killing her three children in 2023. Live updates . 🎧 Streams of Dolly Parton's music on Spotify have jumped over 2,000% in the U.S., and over 1,000% globally, since her death on Tuesday. Top songs: "Jolene" (1.3 million streams) and "9 to 5" (1.1 million), Axios Nashville's Adam Tamburin reports. Essential albums . 
 
