 4. 🍦 1 food thing: Chicken salad cone, anyone? 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The pickle pie wasn't for us, but we loved the Hmong corn dog and the savory cones. Photos: Audrey Kennedy/Axios The chicken salad cones on offer at this year's Minnesota State Fair are a hit, Axios' Torey Van Oot, Kyle Stokes, Audrey Kennedy and Geoff Ziezulewicz report from their whirlwind food tour. 

 The Axios Twin Cities team writes: "We spent five hours braving the crowds, lines and calories to taste-test this year's buzziest and most intriguing new foods." Torey, Geoff, Audrey and Kyle. Photo: Torey Van Oot/Axios 🌭 Their other must-tries: The Hmong corn dog, ube cheesecake wontons, cracklin' corn ribs, and elote tots.

 Honorable mentions: Tanghulu (a candy-covered kabob), a mango sticky rice refresher, and jerk chicken loaded fries. Dig in ... Get Axios Local . 

 
 
